B.a63=new A.ap("1. Information We Collect\n\nWe collect information you provide directly to us, such as when you create an account, send messages, or contact us for support.\n\n2. How We Use Your Information\n\nWe use the information we collect to provide, maintain, and improve our services, including to facilitate secure communication between users.\n\n3. Information Sharing\n\nWe do not sell, trade, or otherwise transfer your personal information to third parties without your consent, except as described in this policy.\n\n4. Data Security\n\nWe implement security measures to protect your messages and personal information. Your data is secured both in transit and at rest.\n\n5. Your Rights\n\nYou have the right to access, update, or delete your personal information at any time through your account settings.\n\n6. Contact Us\n\nIf you have any questions about this privacy policy, please contact us at support@adrde.com.",null,B.Fd,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
